questions.question_text:
A developer has a Container App with a main container configured for 1.0 vCPU / 2.0 GiB and wants to add a logging sidecar that requires 0.25 vCPU / 0.5 GiB. What must the total app provisioning be set to?

```json
{
  "name": "main",
  "resources": { "cpu": 1.0, "memory": "2Gi" }
},
{
  "name": "sidecar",
  "resources": { "cpu": 0.25, "memory": "0.5Gi" }
}
```
